> +-------+---------+----------+----------------------+---------------------+
> |  idx  |  depth  |  parent  |         kind         |       detail        |
> +-------+---------+----------+----------------------+---------------------+
> |   0   |    0    |   none   |  RowParameterLookup  |  source=t28 key=$1  |
